      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعمق البِئْرَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِعْمَاقٌ</span>; (S, O;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَّقَهَا</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْمِيقٌ</span>; (S, O;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْتَمَقَهَا</span></b> ; (O, K;) <i>He made the well deep:</i>
(S, O, Msb, K, TA:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امعقها</span>. (TA.) ― 
